          %h2#properties Properties
          %h3#RingAndModuleStructureOnCohomologyGroups Ring and module structure on cohomology groups
          #RingAndModuleStructureOnCohomologyGroupsOfMultiplicativeCohomplogyTheory.num_prop
            %h6#proposition Proposition
            %p
              Let
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
