          %h3#multiplicative_atiyahhirzebruch_spectral_sequences Multiplicative Atiyah-Hirzebruch spectral sequences
          #AHSSForMultiplicativeCohomologyTheoryIsMultiplicative.num_prop
            %h6#proposition_2 Proposition
            %p
              Given a multiplicative cohomology theory
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
