              the corresponding
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Atiyah-Hirzebruch+spectral+sequence"} Atiyah-Hirzebruch spectral sequence
              inherits the structure of a
              = succeed "." do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/multiplicative+spectral+sequence"} multiplicative spectral sequence
          %p
            A proof of prop.
            %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#AHSSForMultiplicativeCohomologyTheoryIsMultiplicative"}
            via
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Cartan-Eilenberg+systems"} Cartan-Eilenberg systems
            is given at
            = succeed "." do
